    "scenesThatPass": [
      "KATHERINE: How do I put this? I don't like flowers in the workplace. We're not running a boutique.\nTESS: I don't usually, um ... my birthday, a few days ago.\nKATHERINE: Well, no kidding. Mine's next Tuesday. How old?\nTESS: Twenty-eight.",
      "KATHERINE: A few ground rules. The way I look at it, you're my link with the outside world. People's impression of me starts with yOu. You're tough whe…\nTESS: Right.\nKATHERINE: I take my coffee black, my lunches at $ne, and you might want to keep a pack of Larks in your desk. I'm never on another line, I'm in a meet…\nTESS: How do I look?",
      "KATHERINE: Tess, I'm having a little cocktail thing to introduce myself to the department, and Ginny here's got some great ideas. Jot them down?\nGINNY: The caterer's called Acme Eats, you'll get the number from information, they do the usual hors d'ouevres and such ...\nGINNY: ... The Raging Bull has a bartender service, and the liquor store on Broadway and Liberty delivers ... Got that, Bess?\nTESS: Tess. Yes. If that's the way you want to go ...",
      "TESS: Also serve! Yes! Serve!\nKATHERINE: Five minutes and counting!\nTESS: They won't serve!\nKATHERINE: They're cooks. Can't stay. Somebody got the deal botched up.",
      "TESS: Didn't go well.\nKATHERINE: Boone's gonna eat West Air for breakfast. Need a white knight and there's no one in sight. I'm really, truly fucked.\nTESS: I ordered your couch, sent your sister the Filofax calendar, ahd your gynecologist can take you Tuesday at eleven.\nKATHERINE: No good. See if you can move it up to twelve."
    ]
  },
